PERIOD_CHECKSUM
Usage: node scripts/verify-report-set-evidence.js evidence.json [--json]
Checks both embedded original checksums and recomputes the saved comparison. No external source files, network, imports or input writes.
Input contains full unencrypted original evidence. The returned review omits original notes, balances and events.
Exit 0: comparison matches; 2: comparison differs; 1: invalid input/read failure. Matching does not authenticate the source or recheck the chain.
